---
description: defines the use of FastAPI and related libraries for building the application, guiding the architectural deisions in the 'app' directory.
globs: **/app/**/*.*
---
- ALWAYS use Python 3.12
- Use FastAPI for building APIs
- Frameworks:
    - fastapi
    - pydantic
    - sqlalchemy
- use fastapi-users for user management
- use fastapi-jwt-auth for authentication
- use fastapi-cache for caching
- use fastapi-limiter for rate limiting
- use fastapi-pagination for pagination
- use pure functions and as